<p><img class="" style="display: block; float: right; margin: 10px auto 10px auto;" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/Valentine/metamajor.png" alt="Metamajor Logo" width="156" height="156" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>From Astronomy to Oceanography, many Physical Science classes at Lake Tahoe Community College can be applied to a variety&nbsp;of&nbsp;degrees. Courses emphasize exploration and the study of Lake Tahoe and the surrounding area. Come study the Physical Sciences in&nbsp;a natural lab of outstanding beauty and richness.</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
